bound-lock/1 about="the one package beside topos this world-s code imports, a YAML reader (ISC, sha512-3NxN8+78OdzbT7C/WjGsyfPAtJaN3FNDsWxv7Y7mcDsT/oOmgW8BpyQQFFBnvZE3j9Y2Sdz1ULFLezL7Eb2yFw==), pinned exactly and bundled into the blob, so selecting the world loads nothing beside it; the tree law that admits topos and obligations alone holds it as a debt the owner settles" at=policy:topos/capsule form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=capsule/dependencies value=yaml@2.9.1
