bound-lock/1 about="x-access, this world-s extension: components/x-access/<issuer> declares how access is obtained as numbered steps (an operation of a source, an address, or a page the person visits) with inputs (a form, a one-time code, a choice, a secret) and expressions over $inputs, $steps and $response; a security scheme takes one by $ref, across the documents a place holds and nowhere else. The host runs it and holds what it obtains; a value the host does not name is refused by the host; the world runs nothing. docs/x-access.md states each step and input" at=policy:topos/capsule form=alphabet measure=id role=writes scope=form/openapi/x-access value=components/x-access
bound-lock/1 about="{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"allowImportingTsExtensions\": true,\n    \"declaration\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"forceConsistentCasingInFileNames\": true,\n    \"incremental\": true,\n    \"module\": \"NodeNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"NodeNext\",\n    \"noFallthroughCasesInSwitch\": true,\n    \"noImplicitOverride\": true,\n    \"noImplicitReturns\": true,\n    \"outDir\": \"dist\",\n    \"rewriteRelativeImportExtensions\": true,\n    \"rootDir\": \"src\",\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"target\": \"ES2020\",\n    \"tsBuildInfoFile\": \".cache/tsbuildinfo\"\n  },\n  \"include\": [\n    \"src\"\n  ]\n}\n" at=policy:openapi/native-document-compatibility/0.1.2 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/documents/tsconfig value=lock
bound-lock/1 about="{\n  \"name\": \"@lapxo/topos-openapi\",\n  \"version\": \"0.1.2\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"description\": \"A world of APIs built on topos: any OpenAPI 3 document read as a lock, its operations as forms and its methods as declared effects, never as proven ones.\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n  \"author\": \"Lapxo\",\n  \"repository\": {\n    \"type\": \"git\",\n    \"url\": \"git+https://github.com/Lapxo/topos-openapi.git\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"topos\",\n    \"world\",\n    \"openapi\",\n    \"effects\"\n  ],\n  \"sideEffects\": false,\n  \"engines\": {\n    \"node\": \">=22.15\"\n  },\n  \"exports\": {\n    \".\": {\n      \"types\": \"./dist/index.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./dist/index.js\"\n    },\n    \"./package.json\": \"./package.json\"\n  },\n  \"files\": [\n    \"dist\",\n    \"README.md\",\n    \"LICENSE\",\n    \"TARGET.bound\"\n  ],\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"tsc --build\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@lapxo/topos\": \"0.2.0\",\n    \"yaml\": \"2.9.1\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@types/node\": \"22.20.5\",\n    \"esbuild\": \"0.28.2\",\n    \"typescript\": \"5.9.3\"\n  }\n}\n" at=policy:openapi/native-document-compatibility/0.1.2 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/documents/manifest value=lock
